{"title":"Ontario Invitational Mathematics Examination","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Ontario Invitations Mathematics Examination (or OIME) is a math competition hosted by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ontario_Competitive_Mathematics_Committee\" title=\"Ontario Competitive Mathematics Committee\">Ontario Competitive Mathematics Committee</a>.\n</p><p>The OIME has 10 questions, which requires full solutions. Question difficulties range from early <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME</a> questions to mid level <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canadian_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Canadian Mathematical Olympiad\">Canadian Mathematical Olympiad</a> (CMO) questions.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Ontario_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018102128\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 373/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.354      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.354      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35234:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018102128 and revision id 273037. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}